WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.480
- So here's some hashtag not legal advice

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.630
for people that are engaging

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:05.610
in tons and tons of criminality.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.220
If someone asks you to write down a list

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:09.190
of all of the crimes
that you have committed,

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:10.730
even if you're trying to get a pardon,

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.370
maybe don't write those down,

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:14.720
but that advice is apparently
too late for Joel Greenberg

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.820
who apparently asked Roger
Stone to get a pardon for him

00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:20.390
from former President Donald
Trump and in the process

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.760
of doing so, he wrote
down all of the crimes

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.285
that he and his friend
Congressman Gaetz had engaged in

00:00:26.285 --> 00:00:29.810
that would obviously require
a pardon from the President.

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:33.460
So, yeah, here's the
thing, don't do that, ever.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:36.530
Do not ever write down all
the crimes that you have done

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:38.930
even if you're seeking
a pardon, but you know,

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:40.330
hashtag not legal advice.

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.953
So we'll probably see that guy in court.

